  └─[hat Einheit]─▶ Unterrichtsstunde    (qudt:Unit)
</code></pre> <p>Instead of free text such as „ca. 6 Stunden“ (approx. 6 hours), value and unit are recorded separately in machine-readable form. This enables analyses, e.g. the total number of lessons in a curriculum or the comparison of time allocations between states.</p>

