LP_0000051</code>): Jahrgangsstufe 10</li> <li>G8 Qualifikationsphase (<code>LP_0000050</code>): Jahrgangsstufen 11–12</li> <li>G9 Einführungsphase (<code>LP_0000055</code>): Jahrgangsstufe 11</li> <li>G9 Qualifikationsphase (<code>LP_0000052</code>): Jahrgangsstufen 12–13</li> </ul>

+ − Fit ⛶ DagreForceCircle ConcentricTreeGrid LOD L0 · classes only L1 · + hierarchy L2 · + individuals &amp; object props L3 · + OWL restrictions L4 · + data props &amp; literals L5 · everything except inferred L6 · everything Hidden  Group Facets Style: Ontoink Style: Chowlk Style: Graffoo Style: VOWL PNG SVG TTL Edit Layout Abstract Stats Paths SPARQL Reasoning Edit &amp; Validate Hidden by LOD  ·  pin to reveal× Facets  ·  narrow the view× Suggested SHACL shapes× Cite this ontology× Inferred Triples (OWL-RL)×  Show on graph Validate with Inferences Edit &amp; Validate× Source (data TTL) SHACL Shapes Validation Report Validate Update Graph Reset <p>RDF Daten:</p> <pre><code>@prefix ex: &lt;https://www.example.org/&gt; .
